\fs36 \cf0 BLOCK 2: The Bronze Mission \'96 "The Foundation of Pride"\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 1. MISSION VISION & PHILOSOPHY\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 The "Aspirational Gap" Strategy:
\f1\b0  The user is a "Class 5" (Bronze) student. They should feel 100% supported in their current curriculum but 100% hungry for the next grade.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Aspiration:
\f1\b0  The dashboard must visually tease the Gold (BrandBoost) and Platinum (Lead Gen) rewards. They shouldn't just see a list of tasks; they should see a ladder.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Transparency:
\f1\b0  Every single task must have a "Why" (Reason for optimization) and a "How" (Resources).\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ownership:
\f1\b0  The agent should feel that "Optimizing my profile" isn't a chore for the company; it\'92s a power-up for their personal wealth.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 2. THE DATA AUDIT ENGINE (Spreadsheet Logic)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The system will audit the 
\f2\fs26 Agents_Master
\f1\fs24  tab. A mission is "Active" if it meets this specific binary condition:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Condition:
\f1\b0  Column 
\f2\fs26 [Task Name] Link
\f1\fs24  is NOT empty AND Column 
\f2\fs26 [Task Name] Branded
\f1\fs24  is "No" or empty.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Goal:
\f1\b0  Convert all "No" values to "Yes" through submission and manual marketing approval.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Key Data Columns for Bronze:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Identity:
\f1\b0  Headshot, Zoho Email Signature, Business Card, InstaCard.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Socials:
\f1\b0  Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, YouTube, X (Twitter).\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Verification:
\f1\b0  Website/Microsite Branding, eXp Hub Profile (100%), WhatsApp Business.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 3. UI/UX: "MISSION CONTROL" DESIGN\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The UI will use a 
\f0\b Glassmorphism Grid
\f1\b0  layout, moving away from the "Eligibility Gate" feel into a professional command center.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 A. The Progress Orbit (The Hook)
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 A central circular gauge showing "Percentage to Silver."\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Below it, a tiny "Locked" icon for Silver Rewards (Regus & Canva Ent.) that pulses slightly.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 B. Task Categorization
\f1\b0  Tasks will be grouped into three "Mission Packs" so the agent isn't overwhelmed:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Pack 1: Professional Identity
\f1\b0  (Email Sig, Headshot, Cards).\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Pack 2: Social Domination
\f1\b0  (FB, Insta, LI, YT, X).\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls13\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Pack 3: Ecosystem Mastery
\f1\b0  (eXp Hub, Slack, WhatsApp).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 C. The "Smart Card" System (Resource Heavy)
\f1\b0  Each task card will feature a two-tier interaction model:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls14\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Resource Hub (Internal):
\f1\b0  Each card has a "Resources" button that slides open to show:\
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls15\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Watch:
\f1\b0  A 1-minute video tutorial.\
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls16\ilvl1
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Read:
\f1\b0  A 3-step branding guide.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls17\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Action Hub:
\f1\b0  A "Submit for Review" button that opens the submission modal.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 4. TECHNICAL EXECUTION (The "Plumbing")\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls18\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Webhook Mapping:
\f1\b0  Submissions must include 
\f2\fs26 pillar: "Bronze"
\f1\fs24  and 
\f2\fs26 task_id: "[Column_Name]"
\f1\fs24 .\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls19\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Make.com Routing:
\f1\b0  Data must be filtered by the "Bronze" pillar and sent to the 
\f2\fs26 Verification_Bronze
\f1\fs24  tab.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls20\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 State Persistence:
\f1\b0  Once a task is submitted, the card status changes to 
\f0\b "\uc0\u9203  Under Review"
\f1\b0  (Yellow). It only turns 
\f0\b "\uc0\u9989  Optimized"
\f1\b0  (Green) once the Google Sheet 
\f2\fs26 Branded
\f1\fs24  column is updated to "Yes" by the Marketing Team.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 5. THE "HIGH-ASPIRATION" UI ELEMENTS\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 To trigger the 11th/12th-grade envy in our 5th-grade student:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls21\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Locked Horizon:
\f1\b0  A sidebar or footer row showing the "Gold Milestone." It should feature a high-contrast logo of 
\f0\b BrandBoost
\f1\b0  with the text: 
\f3\i "Unlock at Gold Badge \'96 Complete Bronze & Silver to qualify."
\f1\i0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls22\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Live KPI Feedback:
\f1\b0  Instead of just "Completed," use terminology like 
\f0\b "Brand Strength: 45%"
\f1\b0 . As they complete tasks, the "Brand Strength" grows, making them feel like they are becoming a "Heavyweight" in the market.\
